messages[12]{user,text}:
  user_1,[00:00] Hello, uh, is this Anjali? I... I wanted to talk about my car policy.
  user_2,[00:05] Hi Rohan, yes this is Anjali from First Guard Brokers. How can I help you today?
  user_1,[00:10] Yeah, I just got a notice that my auto policy is... um... about to expire? I'm not sure what to do.
  user_2,[00:15] Let me pull up your details... [typing] ... Okay, I see policy #AU-4521, it actually expired on 15/09/2026. 
  user_1,[00:22] Oh, really? I thought I had it active... [sighs] I must have missed something.
  user_2,[00:27] No worries, it happens. Since it's expired, you have a few options: renew now, let it lapse, or switch to a new plan.
  user_1,[00:33] Uh, what are the costs if I just renew the same coverage?
  user_2,[00:38] The renewal premium would be ₹12,500 for the next 12 months, same deductible as before.
  user_1,[00:44] That's... a bit higher than last year. Any discounts?
  user_2,[00:49] We do have a safe driver discount of 5% if you haven't had any claims in the past year. That brings it to about ₹11,875.
  user_1,[00:55] Okay, I think I'll go ahead and renew. Can you process that now?
  user_2,[01:00] Sure thing, I'll send you the renewal invoice and confirm once payment is received. Expect an email in a few minutes.